   35: | `swpctx notflags` | `0xbbbb2222` | `0xaaaa1111` | the defect's exact signature |
   36: | `swpctx flags` | **`0x0`** | **`0xbbbb2222`** | `PCB_A+40` must hold A.flags |
   37: | six controls | ok | ok | encoder, live, exec, palgate, swpctx alive, swpctx mapped |
